Pune Chapter : The Association of Data Scientists (ADaSci) is the premier global professional body of data science & Artificial Intelligence professionals.
Association of Data Scientists will lead in the development, dissemination and implementation of knowledge, basic and applied research and technologies in analytics, decision-making, and management. Association of Data Scientists will strive to:

support efforts to extend, unify and integrate related branches of knowledge and practice;
support the free interchange of information relevant to the purposed of the association;
promote greater use of this knowledge by all organizations and the general public;
encourage the education of students and the continuing education of practitioners in these fields of knowledge;
promote high professional standards and integrity in all work done in the field
Propagate standardization, introduce processes and define industry accepting common definitions.

De RTSM is een platform dat is ontstaan vanuit een behoefte om meer inzicht te krijgen in bijv. Agile Servicemanagement en de toepassing in organisaties. Relevante vraagstukken,  waaronder een aantal voorbeelden zoals onder genoemd, worden in overleg met de deelnemers ingebracht.

•	Wat is Servicemanagement in relatie tot ITIL;
•	Wie of wat is de servicemanager 2.0?;
•	Wat voegt ITIL v3 toe t.o.v. v2;
•	De gewenste (huidige en toekomstige) competenties van de verschillende functies binnen het vakgebied Servicemanagement;
•	De faalfactoren van Servicemanagement in organisaties;
•	Best practices uit verschillende branches;
